@startuml
title Staff Member State Diagram

state "Unassigned" as Unassigned
state "Assigned to Client" as AssignedToClient
state "Added to Campaign" as AddedToCampaign
state "Archived" as Archived
state "Marked as Unemployed" as MarkedAsUnemployed

[*] --> Unassigned

Unassigned --> AssignedToClient : Assign staff member to client
AssignedToClient --> Unassigned : Remove assignment from staff member
Unassigned --> AddedToCampaign : Add staff member to campaign
AddedToCampaign --> Unassigned : Remove assignment from staff member

Unassigned --> MarkedAsUnemployed : Staff member leaves job
MarkedAsUnemployed --> Archived : Archive record after some time has passed

AssignedToClient --> MarkedAsUnemployed : Staff member leaves job
AddedToCampaign --> MarkedAsUnemployed : Staff member leaves job

Archived --> [*]

@enduml
